true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>Power your 12V devices efficiently with the Otech PoE Splitter PD18G. Designed to convert 48V PoE (Power over Ethernet) input into a stable 12V output, this compact and reliable splitter is ideal for IP cameras, routers, access points, and other non-PoE network devices. Featuring Gigabit Ethernet support and IEEE 802.3af/at compatibility, the PD18G ensures fast data transmission and seamless integration into your network setup. Built with durable materials and over-voltage protection, it delivers both performance and safety for critical applications.<br></p><p><br></p><h3>Special Features:</h3><p>Convert 48V PoE to DC 5.5*2.1mm 12V/2A output. DC cable for power supply and RJ45 cable for netework. Non-PoE devices with DC 5.5*2.1mm ports can enjoy the same convenience of POE power as POE devices.</p><p>Auto detect, appropriate power output to connected devices. Up to Max 24W (12V/2A) via DC 5.5*2.1mm connector.</p><p>Support fast gigabit transmission, compatible with 10/100/1000Mbps rates.</p><p>Simply connect to terminal equipment and work, easy to use, avoid complex configuration.</p><p>Isolation circuit protection, Short circuit protection, Overvoltage protection, effectively protect your equipment.</p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Ubiquiti UniFi U-POE-af 48V 0.32A (15W) PoE Adapter","href":"/ubiquiti-unifi-u-poe-af-48v-032a-15w-poe-adapter","now":"2,500৳","old":"2,800৳","single":""},{"name":"Ubiquiti UniFi U-POE-at 48V 0.65A (30W) Gigabit PoE+ Adapter","href":"/ubiquiti-unifi-u-poe-at-48v-065a-30w-gigabit-poe-adapter","now":"3,900৳","old":"4,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Ubiquiti POE-48-24W-G 48V 0.5A (24W) Gigabit PoE Adapter","href":"/ubiquiti-poe-48-24w-g-48v-05a-24w-gigabit-poe-adapter","now":"3,000৳","old":"3,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Ubiqu